xserver-xorg-video-wmt (1.3.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Render the desktop in RGB565 and present it through the VDMA, which
    expands the shadow into the ARGB scanout buffers.
  * Present through the same path with TearFree off or without acceleration.
  * Refuse to start on kernel wmt-drm older than 1.2.
  * Add kmsdev to the option table and the man page.
  * Drop dead members, guards, includes and one-line shims.

 -- Logan Russell <me@lrussell.net>  Sun, 06 Sep 2026 05:03:58 -0400

xserver-xorg-video-wmt (1.2.1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Reject modes the panel did not publish instead of inventing a fallback.
  * Drop the 2D engine size checks from mode validation; EXA already
    enforces them.

 -- Logan Russell <me@lrussell.net>  Sun, 16 Aug 2026 08:00:41 -0400

xserver-xorg-video-wmt (1.2.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Rebind the root pixmap each server generation.
  * Keep depth 32 pixmaps in software; the GE preserves destination alpha.
  * Honor GE wait failures and request the full kernel wait timeout.
  * Drain pending flips before modesets.
  * Resolve unnotified flips from the kernel CRTC state instead of waiting.
  * Fail screen init if EXA setup fails; map the framebuffer when unaccelerated.

 -- Logan Russell <me@lrussell.net>  Fri, 31 Jul 2026 03:11:58 -0400

